        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Steal the Sun"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(divine, evocation)\n\nTrigger: A creature within 30 feet of the sun-spire begins to Cast a Spell that has the fire or light trait\n\nThe sun-spire attempts to redirect the energy from the triggering effect into its sunlight stores. The sun-spire attempts to counteract the triggering spell with a +22 counteract bonus. If it successfully counteracts the spell, the sun-spire's sunlight stores are empowered. While empowered, the sun-spire deals an additional 2d8 fire damage with all of its attacks and abilities. The sun-spire remains empowered until the end of its next turn."
            },
